❮ Math Methods

Thesin()method returns the sine of an angle.

Note:Angles are measured in radians.

Tip:You can use the constantMath.PIto make fractions of PI for angles.

### Code Snippets

```
Example
Return the sine of different angles:
System.out.println(Math.sin(3));
System.out.println(Math.sin(-3));
System.out.println(Math.sin(0));
System.out.println(Math.sin(Math.PI));
System.out.println(Math.sin(Math.PI/2));
Try it Yourself »
```
